        "font": "sans",
        "text": "5. Host allowlist",
        "align": "middle",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": ""
      },
      "index": "b3",
      "parentId": "page:page"
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:a5-body",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 1305,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "props": {
        "text": "Make the trusted host list configurable. Users add hosts (e.g., canvas.instructure.com) in Settings. Matching URLs are treated like Notion pages.\n\nPROS\n✓ Smallest change surface\n✓ WebNavigationDestination already structured for this\n✓ Recent pages shelf works unchanged\n✓ Navigation policy already handles external → browser\n✓ Natural fit with existing architecture\n\nCONS\n✗ Page ID extraction is Notion-specific — needs fallback\n✗ Notion JS injection won't work on external sites\n✗ NotionPageReference still rejects non-Notion hosts\n✗ Title stripping ('| Notion') won't apply\n✗ Muddies 'trusted Notion' vs 'trusted web'\n\nKEY FILES: NotionPageReference.swift, WebNavigationDestination.swift, NotionWebNavigationPolicy.swift, SettingsView.swift, new HostAllowlistStore.swift, PerchSchema.swift\n\nSWITCH BACK: All pages appear in recent pages shelf regardless of host.",
        "size": "s",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "w": 660,
        "autoSize": false
      },
      "index": "b4",
      "parentId": "page:page"
    },
    {
      "id": "shape:rec-header",
      "typeName": "shape",
      "type": "geo",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1250,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "props": {
        "w": 680,
        "h": 45,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "white",
        "fill": "solid",
        "dash": "solid",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "text": "★ Recommendation: Approach 2 — Parallel PinnedPage enum",
        "align": "middle",
